    <item>
      <title>Exploring Tools for Smarter Social Media Management</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/journals/week-4/rakshita/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 09:00:00 -0700</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/journals/week-4/rakshita/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;journal-byline&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;span&gt;&lt;img class=&#34;journal-byline-avatar&#34; src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/members/rakshita_hu_ebfd2408853cfc57.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/members/rakshita-pawar/&#34;&gt;Rakshita Pawar&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  · Social Media Manager Intern&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;journal-byline-back&#34; href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/journals/week-4/&#34;&gt;← First Journals · Week 4&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Exploring Tools for Smarter Social Media Management&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;exploring-tools-for-smarter-social-media-management&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;span&#xD;&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#exploring-tools-for-smarter-social-media-management&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Social Media Manager Journal · SEO Research, Favicon Creation &amp;amp; Open-Source Exploration&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;During Week 4, I began exploring and using digital tools that could support PTHOTH Labs&amp;rsquo; social media and online presence. I worked with OpenSEO to explore keyword research and search-related insights, used Favicon.io to prepare favicon assets for the brand, and continued looking into other useful open-source tools and resources. This week helped me understand how research and small technical tasks can contribute to a more consistent and discoverable digital presence.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
